(vii)
progress report;
(viii)
items such as Budget Plans Programmes and Audit Reports;
(ix)
any matter which the State Government or any other officer authorised by the State Government in this behalf may
require the Board to consider;
(x)
any other matter which may be brought up at the meeting with the permission of the Chairman.
